WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.157
Unit sixteen. Handling Anger!

2
00:00:04.132 --> 00:00:07.916
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:11.216
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.266 --> 00:00:14.884
Today we learn about Handling Anger. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.855 --> 00:00:19.505
Angry. Say it with me. Angry!

6
00:00:23.012 --> 00:00:26.245
Calm. Say it with me. Calm!

7
00:00:29.737 --> 00:00:32.787
Breathe. Say it with me. Breathe!

8
00:00:36.271 --> 00:00:39.404
Count. Say it with me. Count!

9
00:00:42.905 --> 00:00:46.805
Walk away. Say it with me. Walk away!

10
00:00:50.328 --> 00:00:53.595
Talk. Say it with me. Talk!

11
00:00:57.096 --> 00:01:00.630
Words. Say it with me. Words!

12
00:01:04.127 --> 00:01:07.727
Choice. Say it with me. Choice!

13
00:01:11.223 --> 00:01:22.051
Everyone feels angry sometimes. I can breathe slowly, count to ten, or walk away to feel calm. Then I talk and use kind words. I make a good choice instead of hitting.

14
00:01:22.101 --> 00:01:23.385
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.723 --> 00:01:29.829
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.879 --> 00:01:31.029
Breathe!

17
00:01:31.752 --> 00:01:36.811
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.861 --> 00:01:38.011
Words!

19
00:01:39.078 --> 00:01:44.414
Did you know? Counting slowly gives your brain time to think before you act!

20
00:01:44.464 --> 00:01:46.484
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.225 --> 00:01:54.838
Think and answer. What helps you calm down when you are angry?

22
00:01:54.888 --> 00:01:56.038
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.249 --> 00:02:02.228
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.278 --> 00:02:05.065
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

